Ecosystem-wide analysis (migrated to Go)

Usage:
  eshu ecosystem [command]

Available Commands:
  index       Removed: use the supported local or admin indexing flows instead
  overview    Show ecosystem overview
  status      Removed: no dedicated ecosystem status command is supported

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for ecosystem

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu ecosystem [command] --help" for more information about a command.
